<title>FRANCE: AXA sells Finextel stake.</title>
<headline>AXA sells Finextel stake.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>French insurance group AXA-UAP said on Friday it had sold its 34.81 percent holding in real estate company Finextel for 458 million francs to real estate group Sophia.</p>
<p>AXA said in a statement that the sale was part of the group's overall strategy to reduce its real estate exposure.</p>
<p>It also said Sophia would launch a simplified public offering of Finextel shares at 117 francs per share, the same price it bought the shares from AXA.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
